    {
      "id": "fletching-some-arrows",
      "title": "Fletching some arrows",
      "anchor": "Fletching_some_arrows",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "note",
          "html": "Buying <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Wolf_bone_arrowheads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">wolf bone arrowheads</a> or <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Ogre_arrow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ogre arrows</a> from the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Grand_Exchange\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Grand Exchange</a> will not work."
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "fletching-some-arrows:epavfs",
          "html": "Chop down two <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Achey_Tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Achey Trees</a>.",
          "text": "Chop down two Achey Trees.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "fletching-some-arrows:1oznapq",
          "html": "Craft ogre arrow shafts from the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Achey_tree_logs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">logs</a>.",
          "text": "Craft ogre arrow shafts from the logs.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "fletching-some-arrows:17km8ah",
          "html": "Use <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Feather\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">feathers</a> on the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Ogre_arrow_shafts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ogre arrow shafts</a>.",
          "text": "Use feathers on the ogre arrow shafts.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "fletching-some-arrows:1wmmp0c",
          "html": "Obtain some <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Wolf_bones\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">wolf bones</a>. There are some wolves just south-west of Rantz, by the swamp.",
          "text": "Obtain some wolf bones. There are some wolves just south-west of Rantz, by the swamp.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "fletching-some-arrows:14lm597",
          "html": "Craft <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Wolf_bone_arrowheads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">wolf bone arrowheads</a> from the wolf bones.",
          "text": "Craft wolf bone arrowheads from the wolf bones.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": [
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "fletching-some-arrows:14lm597:1m3mle0",
              "html": "Be careful not to bury the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Bones\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">bones</a>.",
              "text": "Be careful not to bury the bones.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "fletching-some-arrows:fjg4da",
          "html": "Use the wolf bone arrowheads on the shafts.",
          "text": "Use the wolf bone arrowheads on the shafts.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "fletching-some-arrows:z7jtxp",
          "html": "Use 6 ogre arrows on Rantz.",
          "text": "Use 6 ogre arrows on Rantz.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "bloated-toads",
      "title": "Bloated toads",
      "anchor": "Bloated_toads",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "bloated-toads:1cykwlm",
          "html": "Ask Rantz all possible questions.",
          "text": "Ask Rantz all possible questions.",
          "dialogue": [
            {
              "when": null,
              "options": [
                {
                  "key": "1",
                  "text": "How do we make the chompys come?"
                },
                {
                  "key": "2",
                  "text": "What are 'fatsy toadies'?"
                },
                {
                  "key": "3",
                  "text": "Where do we put the fatsy toadies?"
                },
                {
                  "key": "4",
                  "text": "What do you mean 'sneaky..sneaky, stick da chompy?'"
                },
                {
                  "key": "5",
                  "text": "Ok, thanks."
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "bloated-toads:3f3pr8",
          "html": "Enter the cave north of Rantz.",
          "text": "Enter the cave north of Rantz.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "bloated-toads:xeymrp",
          "html": "Unlock the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Locked_Ogre_chest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Locked Ogre chest</a> in the north-west corner, then search it to receive <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Ogre_bellows\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ogre bellows</a>.",
          "text": "Unlock the Locked Ogre chest in the north-west corner, then search it to receive ogre bellows.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "bloated-toads:c2bn6g",
          "html": "Exit the cave and run a short distance south-west to the swamp.",
          "text": "Exit the cave and run a short distance south-west to the swamp.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "bloated-toads:1yow2va",
          "html": "At the swamp, <i>fill bellows</i> via the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Swamp_bubbles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">swamp bubbles</a>, then <i>bloat</i> 3 nearby <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Swamp_toad_(creature)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">swamp toads</a> for 3 <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Bloated_toad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">bloated toads</a>.",
          "text": "At the swamp, fill bellows via the swamp bubbles, then bloat 3 nearby swamp toads for 3 bloated toads.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "hunting",
      "title": "Hunting",
      "anchor": "Hunting",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "hunting:ljfz4r",
          "html": "Remove any Armour/Augmented Armour this will stop you from killing Chompy",
          "text": "Remove any Armour/Augmented Armour this will stop you from killing Chompy",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "hunting:1x0fuu7",
          "html": "Talk to Rantz.",
          "text": "Talk to Rantz.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "hunting:1wqhhfu",
          "html": "Drop a bloated toad where the arrow points and wait for a chompy to appear.",
          "text": "Drop a bloated toad where the arrow points and wait for a chompy to appear.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": [
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "hunting:1wqhhfu:3eo66h",
              "html": "You may need to drop more toads if the bird doesn&#39;t spawn.",
              "text": "You may need to drop more toads if the bird doesn't spawn.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "hunting:wx9u1i",
          "html": "Talk to Rantz after the chompy appears.",
          "text": "Talk to Rantz after the chompy appears.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "hunting:1qvamsx",
          "html": "Wait until Rantz has fired his bow and missed the bird, then talk to him.",
          "text": "Wait until Rantz has fired his bow and missed the bird, then talk to him.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "hunting:c3t1w5",
          "html": "Convince him to let you try shooting the bird instead. He&#39;ll give you an <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Ogre_bow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ogre bow</a>.",
          "text": "Convince him to let you try shooting the bird instead. He'll give you an ogre bow.",
          "dialogue": [
            {
              "when": null,
              "options": [
                {
                  "key": "2",
                  "text": "Come on, let me have a go..."
                },
                {
                  "key": "1",
                  "text": "I'm actually quite strong...please let me try."
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "hunting:1uvf1wk",
          "html": "Place another toad in the clearing.",
          "text": "Place another toad in the clearing.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": [
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "hunting:1uvf1wk:17o5rbc",
              "html": "Alternatively, you can kill the same chompy bird, if it has not left.",
              "text": "Alternatively, you can kill the same chompy bird, if it has not left.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "hunting:ygkkx4",
          "html": "Kill the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Chompy_bird\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">chompy bird</a> that appears with the ogre bow.",
          "text": "Kill the chompy bird that appears with the ogre bow.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "hunting:1oht2h8",
          "html": "Pluck the carcass and take the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Raw_chompy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">raw chompy</a>.",
          "text": "Pluck the carcass and take the raw chompy.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "hunting:1b4yboj",
          "html": "Talk to Rantz. Take note of the specific ingredient he wants on the chompy",
          "text": "Talk to Rantz. Take note of the specific ingredient he wants on the chompy",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cooking-the-bird",
      "title": "Cooking the bird",
      "anchor": "Cooking_the_bird",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "cooking-the-bird:1o9577i",
          "html": "Go back into the cave and talk to Fycie and Bugs. Take note of the specific ingredients they want on the chompy, all are possible but not necessarily needed.",
          "text": "Go back into the cave and talk to Fycie and Bugs. Take note of the specific ingredients they want on the chompy, all are possible but not necessarily needed.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "Ingredient<br>Location<br><a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Onion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Onion</a><br>To the west of the swamp where you get the bloated toads, planted near the tomato on a stool, there&#39;s a fire and some ogres, right around there. You need to pick them from the ground, because they don&#39;t appear on the minimap.<br><a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Doogle_leaf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Doogle leaf</a><br>West of onion spawn, on the gnome gliders landing strip in between the fungus (red dot on minimap).<br><a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Tomato\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Tomato</a><br>West of the swamp on a stool, in the same area as the onions (red dot on minimap).<br><a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Cabbage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Cabbage</a><br>On the ground, not too far from the tomatoes or the potatoes.<br><a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Equa_leaf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Equa leaf</a><br>You can get this south-east of Rantz, east of the place you placed your toad for the bait. Equa leaves are small and green so sometimes they can be hard to see, a way to get around this is to use the red dots on your minimap to pin point the location of the equa leaves.<br><a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Raw_potato\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Raw potato</a><br>You can pick a raw potato from a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Potato_(scenery)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">potato plant</a> south-east of Rantz, right beside the equa leaf."
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "cooking-the-bird:s1nsle",
          "html": "Obtain the ingredients that they ask for and use the raw chompy on the spit-roast north of Rantz.",
          "text": "Obtain the ingredients that they ask for and use the raw chompy on the spit-roast north of Rantz.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": [
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "cooking-the-bird:s1nsle:xnzu6w",
              "html": "In case you forgot the ingredients, using the raw chompy on the spit-roast will list them out.",
              "text": "In case you forgot the ingredients, using the raw chompy on the spit-roast will list them out.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "cooking-the-bird:1x0fuu7",
          "html": "Talk to Rantz.",
          "text": "Talk to Rantz.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "cooking-the-bird:fvxipr",
          "html": "Quest complete!",
          "text": "Quest complete!",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        }
      ]
    }
